{'symbol': 'AIG', 'date': '2023-06-07 19:11:00', 'title': 'AIG ANNOUNCES PRICING OF SECONDARY OFFERING OF COREBRIDGE FINANCIAL, INC. COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN INTERNATIONAL GROUP, INC. (NYSE: AIG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS PRICED THE SECONDARY OFFERING OF COREBRIDGE FINANCIAL, INC. (NYSE: CRBG) COMMON STOCK AT $16.25 PER SHARE. THE OFFERING IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE ON JUNE 12, 2023, SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS. AIG, AS THE SELLING STOCKHOLDER, HAS OFFERED 65 MILLION EXISTING SHARES OF COMMON STOCK (OUT OF APPROXIMATELY 648 MILLION TOTAL SHARES OF COMMON STOCK OUTSTANDING) OF COREBRIDGE, CORRESPONDING TO A.'}